    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world of fantasy, the tensions between the weather spirits is growing. If this growing tension is not stopped it could lead to major natural disasters or maybe even... the end of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a group of adventurers who look to quell this divide between the spirits and restore balance to the world's weather. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pepurr: a cat humanoid with orange fur who fights with a sickle and has a mysterious connection to a force known as &quot;The Rot&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meocha: Another cat humanoid with green fur, she is Pepurr's older sister who has trained for years as a monk. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game uses action RPG combat to allow you to switch between playing different party members throughout the adventure and make decisions in real time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trailer music by Apollorc</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world of fantasy, the tensions between the weather spirits is growing. If this growing tension is not stopped it could lead to major natural disasters or maybe even... the end of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a group of adventurers who look to quell this divide between the spirits and restore balance to the world's weather. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pepurr: a cat humanoid with orange fur who fights with a sickle and has a mysterious connection to a force known as &quot;The Rot&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meocha: Another cat humanoid with green fur, she is Pepurr's older sister who has trained for years as a monk. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game uses action RPG combat to allow you to switch between playing different party members throughout the adventure and make decisions in real time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trailer music by Apollorc</p>",
    "short_description": "You and a group of adventurers must travel the world and unite the factions of weather spirits to stop constant natural disasters and stop an inevitable world ending catastrophe once the sky turns &quot;radiant&quot;.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
